# Disk images are NOT committed here and must not be.
#
# Cloudflare Pages refuses any single asset over 25 MiB, and a Git-connected
# deploy uploads the whole repo — so one oversized file fails the ENTIRE
# deploy, silently leaving the live site on the previous commit. FlywheelCAD
# 0.20 is 29.5 MiB (it bundles a CPython runtime; the 0.7-0.10 builds were
# 6-10 MiB and slipped under the limit).
#
# Disk images live in the public repo `flx/flywheelcad-releases` instead. Copy
# the build there as FlywheelCAD-<X.Y>.dmg, commit, push, then point the
# download button at
#   https://github.com/flx/flywheelcad-releases/raw/main/FlywheelCAD-<X.Y>.dmg
# (The application source stays private; only the built image is published.)
downloads/*.dmg
.DS_Store
